                                "example_id": "77227465-398a-4a6a-847d-8e9c3ad0b257",
                                "sense_id": "e4b11ae2-c9aa-3834-be19-67e32c0d4125",
                                "text": "a netful of fish"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "23288f4a-12ea-4ad1-9d19-b1292c93910c",
                                "sense_id": "e4b11ae2-c9aa-3834-be19-67e32c0d4125",
                                "text": "It may be asked, What is a poor man's pot? Bacon, haply a pudding, or \"dow-boy,\" a net of greens, or what not, and a netful of Potatoes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "81220049-0ffa-4df8-8295-e77dc831bf47",
                                "sense_id": "e4b11ae2-c9aa-3834-be19-67e32c0d4125",
                                "text": "Less than 15 years ago a bizarre contraption edged its way alongside a cherry-laden tree in Michigan. An iron hand reached out and shook the tree violently. The cherries fell into a net beneath; result: a netful of bruised cherries."
                            }
